{"t":"dish","r":"dish/bryndzove-halusky","n":"Bryndzové halušky","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Slovak cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Bryndzové halušky, Austrian German: Brimsennocken) is one of the national dishes in Slovakia. This meal consists of halušky (boiled lumps of potato dough similar in appearance to gnocchi) and bryndza (a soft sheep cheese), optionally sprinkled with cooked bits of smoked pork fat or bacon, and chives or spring onions."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-bryndzove-halusky"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bryndzov%C3%A9_halu%C5%A1ky"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Slovak cuisine","cuisine/slovak-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":5,"links":[["Bryndza","ingredient/bryndza"],["Corned beef","ingredient/corned-beef"],["Halušky","ingredient/halusky"],["Potato","ingredient/potato"],["Wheat flour","ingredient/wheat-flour"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Slovak Cooking","ref":"site/slovakcooking-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"slovakcooking.com","note":"English-language site of Slovak home recipes started by a young Slovak cook.","url":"https://www.slovakcooking.com/about/","suggested":true},{"name":"Cook Slovak","ref":"site/cookslovak-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"cookslovak.com","note":"Blog of traditional Slovak recipes and food customs.","url":"https://cookslovak.com/category/recipes/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Slovak cuisine","links":[["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Halušky","dish/halusky"],["Liptauer","dish/liptauer"],["Székelykáposzta","dish/szekelykaposzta"],["Tarhonya","dish/tarhonya"],["Trdelník","dish/trdelnik"],["Tsvikli","dish/tsvikli"]]}]},"dish/gaddi-s":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/gaddi-s","n":"Gaddi's","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 2 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Gaddi's is a French haute cuisine restaurant situated in The Peninsula Hong Kong hotel.  It was opened in 1953 and named after a former general manager of The Peninsula, Leo Gaddi.  The current chef de cuisine is Albin Gobil."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-gaddi-s"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaddi's"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["French cuisine","cuisine/french-cuisine"],["New Caledonian cuisine","cuisine/new-caledonian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pardon Your French","ref":"site/pardonyourfrench-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"pardonyourfrench.com","note":"Audrey Le Goff, a French cook, shares classic and regional French home recipes.","url":"https://pardonyourfrench.com","suggested":true},{"name":"La Cuisine de Géraldine","ref":"site/lacuisinedegeraldine-fr","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"lacuisinedegeraldine.fr","note":"French home cooking blog by Géraldine Leverd, also author of The New French Kitchen.","url":"https://lacuisinedegeraldine.fr/en/about-us","suggested":true},{"name":"New Caledonia Tourism: Kanak cooking","ref":"site/newcaledonia-travel","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"newcaledonia.travel","note":"Official tourism board overview of Kanak food, including bougna cooked in an earth oven.","url":"https://www.newcaledonia.travel/nz/gastronomy-wine/gastronomy/kanak-cooking","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from French cuisine","links":[["'t Fornuis","dish/t-fornuis"],["'t Misverstant","dish/t-misverstant"],["'t Vlasbloemeken","dish/t-vlasbloemeken"],["&moshik","dish/moshik"],["Aan de Poel","dish/aan-de-poel"],["Adrian (restaurant)","dish/adrian-restaurant"],["Adventureland Bazaar","dish/adventureland-bazaar"],["Alain Ducasse at The Dorchester","dish/alain-ducasse-at-the-dorchester"],["Albufera sauce","dish/albufera-sauce"],["Alex (restaurant)","dish/alex-restaurant"],["Andouillette","dish/andouillette"],["Arpège (restaurant)","dish/arpege-restaurant"],["Aspic","dish/aspic"],["Atelier Crenn","dish/atelier-crenn"],["Au Coin d